{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified a three-node K3s Kubernetes cluster across the two private LANs routed by VyOS. node2 is the Ready control plane; node3 and node4 are Ready workers. Pod networking, CoreDNS, ClusterIP services, private data-plane binding, and persistence across sequential restarts of all four nodes were proven.","actions_performed":["Configured and saved VyOS routing between 10.100.89.0/24 and 10.100.118.0/24.","Added persistent private cross-LAN routes on all Ubuntu nodes.","Installed K3s with node IPs and Flannel VXLAN explicitly bound to enp8s0.","Deployed worker-hosted test pods and a ClusterIP service.","Verified cross-LAN pod ICMP/HTTP, DNS, service proxying, and private API binding.","Restarted node1 through node4 sequentially and verified changed boot IDs and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"VyOS routing between lan-a and lan-b","command_ids":["cmd-1bd38eb5711b4af5","cmd-edd8fec3ad0846b6","cmd-07e08d0771764489","cmd-ef201e0a29574449","cmd-e644bbe8ad604297"],"summary":"VyOS owns both private gateways, forwards traffic, and shows live forwarded packet counters; bidirectional routed pings succeed."},{"requirement":"All Kubernetes members Ready on private LAN addresses","command_ids":["cmd-4d6353efa56e490e","cmd-f80a0582121346b7"],"summary":"node2, node3, and node4 are Ready with InternalIP and Flannel addresses exclusively on the private LANs."},{"requirement":"Cross-LAN pod networking, cluster DNS, and ClusterIP services","command_ids":["cmd-9c701b8a90234f4c","cmd-33a787a077a64125","cmd-f80a0582121346b7"],"summary":"Worker endpoints on both pod CIDRs respond from the control-plane pod; CoreDNS resolves services from both LANs, and the ClusterIP returns worker-hosted data."},{"requirement":"Management network excluded from Kubernetes data plane","command_ids":["cmd-bec6c9b2b30046b0","cmd-800bd1794f244237","cmd-ad2964b99f3140d6"],"summary":"K3s node IPs, API binding, private routes, and Flannel VXLAN interfaces explicitly use enp8s0 and the 10.100.89/118 private networks."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-540f3cfece7747da","cmd-79b6f8e72a184ba2","cmd-f42d9f5669104467","cmd-eb477d99aa594da0"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored VyOS state, and recovered cluster traffic are shown."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-902155eebdaa4f6f","cmd-83fde2c7da5044b9","cmd-2125a1f7720c4995","cmd-e3aab30de2894939","cmd-c5110f370a534568"],"summary":"Healthy control-plane baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, Ready membership, recovered pods, DNS, and service traffic are shown."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-d21544e9920a4f85","cmd-b687219f90f548c9","cmd-02fda5992a2346ef","cmd-1e10f6b02a00455d","cmd-20b5e9a97ab6462a","cmd-935c67e823b94786"],"summary":"Healthy worker baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored private VXLAN/route, Ready membership, and recovered workload traffic are shown."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-72901c8573fe4875","cmd-bc78e56068cb4074","cmd-21b4d06b761446ea","cmd-fedec9837d244703","cmd-8d5f3db36e544002","cmd-aec664024cef4dbb"],"summary":"Healthy worker baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored private VXLAN/route, Ready membership, and recovered workload traffic are shown."}]}
